 "body": {
  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "Who is on call for the team that owns the service the ledger depends on?\n[2025-01-08] standup/atlas/2025-01-08: For the record, Ledger is owned by team Atlas. [2025-02-06] standup/dune/2025-02-06: If the ledger service is down, the reports pipeline is down: it relies on it for the nightly balance export. [2025-02-06] standup/atlas/2025-02-06: Billing-api calls the ledger service for invoice postings, so treat the ledger service as a hard dependency of billing-api.",
